  "reasoning": "The defendant Chen possessed a simulated Type‑64 pistol and five rounds of military ammunition, which are classified as firearms and ammunition under the law. The facts show he both possessed (非法持有) and stored/kept (私藏) these items. According to the correction rule, both elements must be listed. No other illegal activities such as manufacturing, buying, selling, transporting, or mailing are described, so only the offenses related to illegal possession and private storage of firearms and ammunition apply. The proper charge names are expressed without the suffix “罪” and separated by a semicolon.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]非法持有枪支、弹药;私藏枪支、弹药<eoa>"
